      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Two foothills towns west and south of Calgary, both of which grew between the 2016 and 2021 censuses. Tell us what your wall looks like and an independent stucco contractor quotes the job after seeing it.</p>
