<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Stucco repair in Cochrane and Okotoks starts the same way it does in Calgary: someone walks the wall, finds where the finish has cracked, pocked or lost its bond, and writes down what the fix involves. Sandstone Stucco Co is an advertising service, paid by contractors, that puts homeowners in touch with independent stucco contractors. We do not do the work ourselves, and the contractor who quotes your job contracts directly with you.</p><p>Both towns have grown, Cochrane much faster. Cochrane had 32,199 people in 2021, up 24.5% from 2016, in 12,578 private dwellings, and Okotoks had 30,405, up 4.8%, in 10,750 dwellings (2021 census).</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Cochrane & Okotoks</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Cochrane & Okotoks Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Hail damage scope</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Pocked or cracked stucco after a storm can be walked by a contractor who writes up a repair estimate. You can give that written estimate to your insurer; the claim itself stays between you and your insurer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Flicker and woodpecker holes</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Northern flickers are federally protected, so a hole has to be empty before anyone touches it. A contractor can then patch it and talk through non-harmful deterrents such as mesh.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Cracks, bulges and window trim</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Cracks at corners, around windows or at the base of a wall can let water in before you see a stain. A contractor can look at where moisture may be getting behind the finish and quote the repair.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Foundation parging and recoats</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Flaking or crumbling parging on the visible part of the foundation, and tired or patchy finish coats, can be quoted for repair or recoating. Cracks in the foundation wall itself are a separate question for a structural specialist.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
